    bbcLinks: "<a href=\"https://bbc.pokerth.net/registration\">Calendario e inscripción</a> · <a href=\"https://bbc.pokerth.net/results\">Resultados</a> · <a href=\"https://bbc.pokerth.net/results/ranking\">Clasificación</a>",
    wecH2: "WeCup (WEC)",
